---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Vigilo DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run results
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Validate run id
    Vigilo->>DB: Load run
    DB-->>Vigilo: Run record
    Vigilo->>DB: Load results summary
    DB-->>Vigilo: Summary counts and scores

    alt Results loaded
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build summary-only payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Run or summary lookup fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Results error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
